    "source": {
      "value": "lowg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Whether in Katapesh or one of the bustling markets along the Path of Salt, you've spent enough time buying and selling ancient or unusual items to give you an instinctive ability to quickly sort valuable trinkets from worthless baubles.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Wisdom, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Arcana skill and the Mercantile Lore skill.\n\nYou gain the Quick Identification skill feat."
    },
